  (text "wESP32 RF hat: JP1 odd 1 GND 3 IO23 5 IO39 7 IO32 9 GND 11 IO18 13 IO13 15 IO4 17 IO15 19 GND / even 2 3V3 4 IO36 6 IO34 8 IO35 10 IO33 12 IO5 14 IO14 16 IO12 18 IO2 20 V+(5V)\nRX data is 5 V: 10k/20k divider -> IO34/IO35.  RJ45 end down: modules lie flat, ANT holes at the +x end, coils exit past the x=75 edge.  SRX882 pins 1-2 (ANT, GND) left free: 2/6 both GND, 1/7 both ANT.  Pin 2-3 gap measured 18.22 mm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "cd82723d-3484-401b-9451-28e49bad4b78"))
